    "summary": "In code review, caught a null-safety bug that would have crashed three production components, and fixed the defect class rather than the three instances, by proposing a shared data-layer helper to the PR's author instead of patching each render site myself; one of 310 pull requests I gave an explicit review verdict on that half (702 across four repositories between 2025-03 and 2026-08), measured from the Bitbucket API rather than recalled.",
